<main class="wrap page narrow">
  <h1>About LivedHere</h1>
  <p class="lede">Listing sites sell the dream. LivedHere is for the years after you get the keys — from people who rented or owned the place.</p>
  <p>This is a first working version. Anyone can search addresses and read reviews. Writing, editing, or deleting a review requires an account. There is no review moderation yet, and the seeded reviews use fictional example addresses so you can try the product immediately.</p>
  <p>Working name ideas we considered: <strong>LivedHere</strong> (the one on this site), <strong>AfterStay</strong>, and <strong>ResidentRecord</strong>.</p>
  <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/review">Write a review</a></p>
</main>

